      "the_panquire_t_03_uses_12_inch": "The Panquire T-03 uses 12-inch Kenda road tires for paved surfaces. It has a removable 60V 31.2Ah battery, 9.5 kW peak power and three selectable electronic power levels. Use its model-specific 18A charger. Charging time has yet to be confirmed.",
